        "original_id": "7e5ebb6a-e7f5-5d33-83c3-47dc9b4c3653",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Books: Cold North Killers: Canadian Serial Murder\n- People: Edward H. Rulloff, Russell Williams\n- Places: CFB Trenton, Canada\n- Roles: commander\n\nFacts:\n- Cold North Killers: Canadian Serial Murder documents the lives of sixty Canadian serial killers.\n- In Cold North Killers: Canadian Serial Murder, Edward H. Rulloff is the earliest serial killer covered.\n- From July 2009 until his arrest in February 2010, Russell Williams commanded CFB Trenton.\n- CFB Trenton is a hub for air transport operations in Canada and abroad.\n- CFB Trenton is Canada's largest military airbase.\n- In Cold North Killers: Canadian Serial Murder, Russell Williams is the most recent serial killer covered.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
